WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.001
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:27.501
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:32.501
画外Luca：Harland把订婚宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
画外:Luca: Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:35.001
Luca，关掉车库监控。谁也别下来。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.501
待着。
Stay.

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:40.163
她：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
Her: What do you mean, I caused this? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:45.063
你的气味。是它让我变成这样。
Your scent. That's what did this.

00:00:50.263 --> 00:00:52.563
原来你在这里。Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
There you are. Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:52.763 --> 00:00:55.063
先生……
Sir...
画外:Luca: Sir…

00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:57.725
她：Mate是什么意思？你先说清楚再碰我。
Her: What does Mate mean? Explain it clearly before you touch me.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:02.625
只有一个人。为我而生。一生只有一个。
One person. Made for me. There's only ever one.

00:01:02.825 --> 00:01:05.958
你不点头，我就不碰你。
I won't touch you until you say so.

00:01:09.492 --> 00:01:12.625
跟我走。路上我跟你说。
Come with me. I'll explain on the way.

00:01:12.987 --> 00:01:15.287
她：上车，坐到另一侧
Her: Get in the car and sit on the other side.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:15.387 --> 00:01:20.187
坐到另一侧吧，我坐这边。
Take the far side. I'll sit here.

00:01:22.387 --> 00:01:24.187
开车。
Drive.

00:01:26.387 --> 00:01:28.187
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.187
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.849
她：谁会来找我？还有，刚才那是谁的电话？
Her: Who's coming for me? And whose call was that just now?
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:32.949 --> 00:01:37.749
Selene。本来要嫁给我的那个女人。
Selene. The woman I was meant to marry.

00:01:39.949 --> 00:01:41.749
是我的气味。在这里到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:01:43.949 --> 00:01:45.749
这里是我的领地。在这里没人能碰你。
This is my territory. No one touches you here.

00:01:45.949 --> 00:01:47.749
你们的世界里只在故事里听过的东西。
Something your world only tells stories about.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:50.411
她：不是人类？那你是什么？说清楚。
Her: Not human? Then what are you? Explain it clearly.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.511 --> 00:01:55.311
狼。我是狼人，生来就是。
Wolf. I'm a wolf. Born one.

00:01:58.844 --> 00:02:01.978
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就离开了订婚宴。
I walked out on the engagement the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:02.178 --> 00:02:05.311
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:05.673 --> 00:02:07.973
她：握住他的手：我没在怕
Her: Takes his hand: I'm not afraid.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:10.373
她：我没在怕。真的没有。
I'm not afraid. I'm really not.

00:02:16.406 --> 00:02:19.540
Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
画外:Luca: Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.873
待在我身边。
Stay close to me.

00:02:23.235 --> 00:02:25.535
她：外面是谁？我倒要看看她到底是谁。
Her: Who's outside? I want to see who she really is.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.635 --> 00:02:30.435
Selene。想看就看。
Selene. Look if you want.

00:02:30.635 --> 00:02:32.935
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:02:33.135 --> 00:02:35.435
她轮不到你过问，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:35.635 --> 00:02:37.935
一个人类？满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
A human? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.097
她：满月前带走我？你先说清楚，长老会凭什么。
Her: Take me before the full moon? Explain it clearly. What gives the Elders the right?
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.197 --> 00:02:47.997
族规。人类不能是Mate，他们会定你的罪。
The law. Humans can't be Mates. They'll call it a crime.

00:02:52.197 --> 00:02:53.997
我不会让他们带走你。
I won't let them take you.

00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:00.659
她：我不想逃，我想留下
Her: I don't want to run. I want to stay.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:00.759 --> 00:03:03.059
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:05.759 --> 00:03:08.059
再来一次我还是会这么做，每一次都会。
I'd do it again. Every time.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.559
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:18.221
她：留下可以，先陪我去天台吹吹风。
Her: You can stay, but first come with me to the rooftop for some fresh air.
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.321 --> 00:03:23.121
行。去天台。就我们两个。
Fine. The roof. Just you and me.

00:03:27.321 --> 00:03:29.121
风很冷。很好。靠近我。
Cold wind. Good. Stay close.

00:03:29.321 --> 00:03:31.121
Alpha，Harland召集了长老。
画外:Luca: Alpha. Harland has called the elders.

00:03:33.483 --> 00:03:35.783
她：Harland是谁？长老会要对我们做什么？
（实时生成 · 15 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:40.683
Harland。掌管我们族规的长老。
Harland. The elder who keeps our laws.

00:03:40.883 --> 00:03:43.183
他们会带走你。我不允许。
They'll take you. I won't allow it.

00:03:45.883 --> 00:03:48.183
Alpha，车备好了。
Alpha, the car is ready.
画外:Luca: Alpha. The car is ready.

00:03:48.383 --> 00:03:50.683
今晚，他们亲耳听我说。
Tonight, they hear it from me.
